# chezmoi が管理しない対象（destディレクトリ=~ からの相対パス）
# LazyVim スターター由来の不要物。再取り込み(chezmoi add)時の混入も防ぐ。
.config/nvim/LICENSE
.config/nvim/README.md

# Claude Code — WHITELIST (fail-safe): ignore every direct child of ~/.claude,
# then re-include only what we deliberately manage. Any new/unknown top-level
# entry (including future secrets like .credentials.json, or state dirs) is
# excluded by default.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/commands
!.claude/skills
# top-level auth/state files (not under .claude/) are never managed
.claude.json
.claude.json.backup

# Codex — WHITELIST (fail-safe): ~/.codex holds auth.json and session state.
# Manage only the symlink to the shared agent instructions.
.codex/*
!.codex/AGENTS.md
